legal.privacy.share.body:
We share your information only:
• with our hosting provider, Railway Corporation (United States), which runs our server and database for us. It may use the data only to provide that service, under a data processing agreement that protects it at least as well as this policy;
• with Apple and Google, who distribute the game and handle downloads, ratings and reviews under their own privacy policies;
• when the law requires it, for example a valid court order, or to protect the safety of players or the service;
• with a new owner, if the game is ever transferred, who must keep this policy. We'll tell you before it happens.

legal.privacy.bases.body:
If you live in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom or Switzerland, we use your information:
• to provide the game and the features you use: your account, the leaderboard, Versus and friends (performing our agreement with you);
• for our legitimate interests in keeping the game safe, fair and working, and improving it: logs, anti-cheat checks, reports and word statistics;
• with your consent, for notifications, which you can withdraw at any time;
• to meet our legal obligations.

legal.terms.account.body:
Your account is made automatically and kept on your phone. There's no login, so:
• if you delete the app or lose your phone, your account and progress are gone, and we can't bring them back;
• accounts are for people: one person per account, and no bots or automated play;
• you're responsible for what happens on your account.

legal.terms.fair.body:
Hanged is for everyone to enjoy, so you agree not to:
• cheat, use bots or scripts, modify the game or exploit bugs to gain words, tokens, characters or rating;
• send false data to our server, or try to overload it, break into it or get into other players' accounts;
• harass, threaten, bully or impersonate anyone, including us;
• lose Versus matches on purpose or arrange results to move ratings;
• use the game for anything illegal.
Found a bug? Please tell us instead of using it.

