• Apple's Licensed Application End User License Agreement also applies; where it and these terms differ, it prevails;
• Apple and its subsidiaries are third-party beneficiaries of these terms and may enforce them against you.
If you got it from Google Play, Google Play's terms of service also apply. Either way, you must follow the terms of any service you use with the game, such as your mobile plan, and you confirm that you're not in a country under a US government embargo and not on any US government list of restricted parties.
